{"ok":true,"name":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- The Frozen Bond","desc":"A prequel story set seven years before the beginning of the Re:ZERO series. Emilia lives in a secluded forest covered in snow with the spirit Puck. The forest holds a secret: the elves who once lived there have been frozen into ice. Emilia is feared by the people living on the outskirts of the forest, but makes a humble living selling magic stones and warding off Magic Beasts. One day, however, her peaceful life is disrupted when the Great Spirit of Fire Melakuera decides to lay his judgment upon her.","year":2019,"rating":7.4,"ratingCount":224,"thumb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9K1zhrS8jZ3NFZwzc5RgtwxskLT.jpg","servers":[{"name":"Server 1","src":"https://videm.xyz/embed/movie/tt10112232&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 2","src":"https://vidapi.xyz/embed/movie/566451"},{"name":"Server 3","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vnest?tmdb=566451&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 4","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vcr?tmdb=566451&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 5","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vpls?tmdb=566451&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 6","src":"https://embedmaster.link/movie/tt10112232"},{"name":"Server 7","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vesy?tmdb=566451&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 8","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vsrc?imdb=tt10112232"}],"genres":["Animation","Drama","Fantasy"],"seasons":null,"duration":"PT1H16M","imdb":"tt10112232","related":[{"id":116711,"slug":"epic","title":"Epic","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81cSsWzjTfR3cJSqnTiHwy1eyPK.jpg"},{"id":12600,"slug":"pok-mon-4ever","title":"Pokémon 4Ever","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thz83PS9twtVBEEAM59J1bh75nU.jpg"},{"id":532321,"slug":"re-zero-starting-life-in-another-world-memory-snow","title":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Memory Snow","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7XwmyE5ue9hjk65fEWpO2hGU2B.jpg"},{"id":75258,"slug":"